he one thing the  blood-borne likes is that longevity and  the variety that the Soul series offers  so you know weapons is a good way to  solve that there are two little weapons  in the current game but I'd also like to  see some better PvP areas and maybe  better covenant rewards and stuff that  you really have to earn that's something  that blood-borne lacks and I really hope  that's something blood-borne adds but  what are you looking forward to let me  know subscribe if you want to keep on  top of everything blood-borne related  going forward I'm really craving some  new content sometimes it's tough just  doing souls but yeah I just can't wait  to jump into it with you guys explore it  all and I'll see you all in the next  video

